    <h2 class="h2 rv">Questions, <span class="gray">answered.</span></h2>
    <div class="faq">
      <details class="faq-item rv" open><summary>Will my account get banned?<span class="faq-plus">+</span></summary><p class="faq-a">No. autodm uses official login flows and approved messaging routes, so your accounts stay safe and compliant.</p></details>
      <details class="faq-item rv"><summary>Do you need my password?<span class="faq-plus">+</span></summary><p class="faq-a">Never. You connect with official logins and choose exactly what autodm may access. Remove access any time in one click.</p></details>
      <details class="faq-item rv"><summary>Who decides what autodm may do?<span class="faq-plus">+</span></summary><p class="faq-a">You do. Choose what runs alone, what asks first, and what stays blocked, per channel and per action.</p></details>
      <details class="faq-item rv"><summary>How is autodm trained on my brand?<span class="faq-plus">+</span></summary><p class="faq-a">We load your catalogue, policies, tone and past conversations. Replies sound like your team from day one and keep improving with your feedback.</p></details>
      <details class="faq-item rv"><summary>What happens when autodm is unsure?<span class="faq-plus">+</span></summary><p class="faq-a">It hands the chat to a human with full context. No guessing, no awkward replies.</p></details>
      <details class="faq-item rv"><summary>How long does setup take?<span class="faq-plus">+</span></summary><p class="faq-a">Days, not months. Connect your store and channels, review the training, and go live. Most brands launch within a week.</p></details>
